# Trivy vulnerability ignore list
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CVE-2026-47884: Spring Framework XsltView RCE (fixed in 7.0.9; 6.2.20 not yet released in Maven Central).
# Infinevo Platform is a pure REST API architecture; XsltView is not used or mapped anywhere.
CVE-2026-47884

# CVE-2026-47890: Spring MVC/WebFlux SSE stream corruption when rendering view fragments
# (fixed in 7.0.9; 6.2.20 is enterprise-only). Needs SSE + server-rendered view fragments +
# attacker text streamed to other users. Infinevo has no SseEmitter/event-stream and no server
# views — pure JSON REST, React renders. Remove on the Spring 7 upgrade; do not add SSE before then.
CVE-2026-47890

# CVE-2026-111755: follow-redirects sensitive header leakage via improper regex escaping
CVE-2026-111755

# CVE-2026-111756: follow-redirects information disclosure via array-formatted headers
CVE-2026-111756

# CVE-2026-112942: launch-editor command injection via file path (vite dev-dependency only)
CVE-2026-112942

